    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/6437924e681dfd1c0ab45c5ee6830a4b.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/2ba5be972e593a263b9c90b9172304db.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ce4baeb33c56ab14e5ab72ddf9f906e9.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/d4f90f2124efe8a1fbce7db20830b24c.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/6437924e681dfd1c0ab45c5ee6830a4b.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/2ba5be972e593a263b9c90b9172304db.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ce4baeb33c56ab14e5ab72ddf9f906e9.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/d4f90f2124efe8a1fbce7db20830b24c.avif?t=1755083649\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A rogue-like slot-machine builder about cryptocurrency and capitalism. Score lines and set off chain reactions to generate a fortune. Invest that fortune in upgrades (or back into coins) to amass an even bigger one! All the fun of casinos and day-trading without the risk of financial ruin!",
